  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo a Redes de Proteccin Social para Poblaciones Vulnerables en Surinam</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Safety Nets for Vulnerable Populations in Suriname</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo de esta operacin es apoyar niveles mnimos de ingreso para la poblacin vulnerable durante el periodo de recuperacin de los efectos de la crisis debida a la pandemia de COVID-19.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this operation is to support minimum levels of income for the vulnerable population as the country recovers from the COVID-19 crisis.</narrative>
  </description>
